{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40482","headline":"南海陪郑司空游荔园 · 曹松","name":"南海陪郑司空游荔园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荔枝时节出旌斿，南国名园尽兴游。\n乱结罗纹照襟袖，别含琼露爽咽喉。\n叶中新火欺寒食，树上丹砂胜锦州。\n他日爲霖不将去，也须图画取风流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}